WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,650
The house is mine, and it’s your turn to divide it. If you have the ability, feel free to break in.

2
00:00:03,650 --> 00:00:05,650
I want to see what you are capable of

3
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:09,020
No one can open the lock now

4
00:00:09,020 --> 00:00:10,420
How about we withdraw?

5
00:00:10,420 --> 00:00:11,620
Keep making trouble

6
00:00:11,620 --> 00:00:13,220
In case Chen Zhenghao is attracted

7
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:14,620
None of us can escape

8
00:00:14,620 --> 00:00:15,820
What are you afraid of?

9
00:00:15,820 --> 00:00:17,580
The building is so high

10
00:00:17,580 --> 00:00:19,580
Chen Zhenghao had a hard time climbing up

11
00:00:19,580 --> 00:00:20,780
Even if it's a robbery

12
00:00:20,780 --> 00:00:22,780
They will only start at the lower levels.

13
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:26,110
This Zhang Yi is definitely not simple

14
00:00:26,110 --> 00:00:27,910
As if something had happened a long time ago

15
00:00:27,910 --> 00:00:29,510
Very well prepared

16
00:00:29,510 --> 00:00:30,510
difficult to deal with

17
00:00:30,710 --> 00:00:31,910
Just want to help yourself

18
00:00:31,910 --> 00:00:33,310
Not informing neighbors at all

19
00:00:33,310 --> 00:00:36,580
This person is so abominable. He knew this in advance.

20
00:00:36,580 --> 00:00:37,580
Nothing will work

21
00:00:37,580 --> 00:00:39,380
We just use brute force to break the door.

22
00:00:39,380 --> 00:00:40,580
You three will be the main force
